arista-images/
# Artifact blobs are denied by default.  The current Chapter 05 recovery
# closure is explicitly re-included below so a clean Git checkout can deploy
# the fixed applications and rebuild the kernel-matched Onload module without
# relying on a VM-local vault.  Keep historical runtimes and unrelated vendor
# media ignored unless a later reviewed recovery manifest adds them.
/artifacts/blobs/*
!/artifacts/blobs/x2522/
/artifacts/blobs/x2522/*
!/artifacts/blobs/x2522/ch05-four-path/
!/artifacts/blobs/x2522/onload/
